{"title":"Mercator ↔ Equal Earth","link":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Sep/7/equal-earth/","date":1788798256000,"content":"\n    \n        <p><strong>Tool:</strong> <a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/equal-earth\">Mercator ↔ Equal Earth</a></p>\n        <p>I got curious about the Equal Earth map projection that was recently <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/04/un-vote-world-map-mercator-equal-earth-africa\">voted on at the UN</a> so I had GPT-6 Astra (medium) in ChatGPT Work <a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/share/6a9ee520-c82c-83ea-8111-2f7050c08638\">build me</a> this animated transition between Mercator and Equal Earth using D3.</p>\n\n  \n\n    \n    \n        <p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/geospatial\">geospatial</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/d3\">d3</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/vibe-coding\">vibe-coding</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/gpt-6-astra\">gpt-6-astra</a></p>\n    \n\n","author":"Simon Willison","siteTitle":"Simon Willison’s Weblog","siteHash":"1b599216bd27a00f15d67a3ed9719c64148630c70244b6dd8e743f17cb45527e","entryHash":"59119807ac3b2a7f493477ce1427ae25d9717afb434740a5d6db3368aa88bcab","category":"Tech"}